      "reason": "No overall risk-of-bias judgement was made, so there are no overall judgement rules to report."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Although a risk-of-bias tool has been developed for meta-analyses of disease prevalence [14], many aspects of the tool are not directly relevant to our research question.",
      "reason": "The existing prevalence tool was considered but not used or adapted; no adaptations to any risk-of-bias tool were made."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "A formal assessment for risk of bias was deemed to have limited utility given the lack of an appropriate assessment tool.",
      "reason": "No newly developed risk-of-bias tool is described; the authors used sensitivity-analysis factors rather than creating a new tool."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e6",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "A formal assessment for risk of bias was deemed to have limited utility given the lack of an appropriate assessment tool.",
      "reason": "Since no risk-of-bias assessment was performed, the number of reviewers, their independence, and disagreement-resolution procedures for risk-of-bias assessment are not reported; dual-reviewer procedures are described only for screening (text_7) and data extraction (text_8)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e7",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "A formal assessment for risk of bias was deemed to have limited utility given the lack of an appropriate assessment tool.",
      "reason": "No risk-of-bias assessment was conducted and no processes for obtaining or confirming risk-of-bias information from study investigators are described."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e8",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
